  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this activity is to&#xFFFD;accelerate Ukraine&#xFFFD;s efforts to achieve HIV epidemic control by 2030 by improved&#xFFFD;prevention, testing and linkages to care among key populations. Funded through PEPFAR, the project&#xFFFD;aims to increase the number of people living with HIV who know their status and are linked to HIV care, in order&#xFFFD;to achieve the Joint United Nations&#xFFFD;Programme&#xFFFD;on HIV/AIDS (UNAIDS) 95-95-95 goals for HIV&#xFFFD;epidemic&#xFFFD;control in Ukraine.</narrative>
